    "/apis/v1/spyfu/google-domain-ad-history": {
      "get": {
        "description": "The path segment is `cloud_ad_history_api`, NOT `ad_history_api` — the reference slug and\nthe URL disagree. Siblings in the same family: getDomainAdHistoryByDate, getTermAdHistory,\ngetTermAdHistoryWithStats.\nFor the ads a domain is running RIGHT NOW rather than historically, use\n`/apis/serp_api/v2/ppc/getPaidSerps` (`query` required), which is on the $2.00 PPC CPM.\n\n> **请求示例待验证。** 此接口的请求示例尚未在生产环境验证。静态示例用于说明请求格式，请替换为自己的参数。正式调用前，可用免费的报价模式（`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`）查看预估费用。",
        "operationId": "spyfu.google-domain-ad-history",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "countryCode",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "description": "default US",
              "examples": [
                "US"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "domain",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "description": "the advertiser's root domain",
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "keywordFilter",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "description": "restrict to ads that ran on keywords matching this",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "pageSize",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "description": "1 to 10,000, DEFAULT 5.",
              "maximum": 100,
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "sortBy",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "description": "Best (default) | Worst | KeywordAsc | KeywordDesc | SearchDateId",
