    "/apis/v1/spyfu/google-domain-overview": {
      "get": {
        "description": "`/apis/domain_stats_api/v2/getAllDomainStats` is the same report over the domain's ENTIRE\nhistory — one row per month since SpyFu started tracking it, which for an old domain is\n150+ billable rows from a call that looks parameterless. That full-history variant is what\ntreg's registry probes; prefer this endpoint with an explicit `pastNMonths` for real work.\n\n> **请求示例待验证。** 此接口的请求示例尚未在生产环境验证。静态示例用于说明请求格式，请替换为自己的参数。正式调用前，可用免费的报价模式（`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`）查看预估费用。",
        "operationId": "spyfu.google-domain-overview",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "countryCode",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "description": "two-letter code from SpyFu's 28-value enum; default US",
              "examples": [
                "US"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "domain",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "description": "bare domain, no scheme",
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "pastNMonths",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "description": "how many recent months to return, ONE ROW PER MONTH. Ask for 1 unless you need the trend",
              "maximum": 12,
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "properties": {
                    "domain": {
